1. Description

    Developed a dedicated Medicine Subscription Dashboard for the Pharma Store to give customers a centralized view of their active and recurring medicine subscriptions.

    The dashboard provides an overview of subscription activity, upcoming deliveries, estimated spending, subscription status, and individual subscription details. It also integrates with the medicine subscription and automated refill workflows implemented previously.

    The primary goal was to make recurring medicine management simple, transparent, and easy to understand from a single dashboard.

2. Business Requirement

    Customers using recurring medicine subscriptions need a centralized location to monitor their subscriptions without having to navigate through multiple pages.

    The dashboard was designed to allow customers to:

    View active subscriptions.
    Monitor upcoming medicine deliveries.
    Check subscription status.
    View estimated recurring spending.
    Track subscription savings.
    Review medicine and quantity details.
    Access subscription management actions.
    Monitor refill information.


