10. Subscription Management Actions

     The dashboard provides access to subscription management functionality.

     Available actions include:

     View Details

     Opens the complete subscription information.

     Pause

     Temporarily stops recurring deliveries.

     Resume

     Restarts a paused subscription.

     Skip Next Delivery

     Skips the next scheduled refill while keeping the subscription active.

     Cancel

     Stops future recurring deliveries.

